Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 17:37:36 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] tools(4leaf): OBS action evidence audit (PR #420) keeps
 unreadable members, adds geometry runs

Includes PR #420's audit-obs-action-evidence.py and its test, with the two
review findings fixed:
- members whose native frame count cannot be read (e.g. 1095.obs) were
  silently dropped; they are now listed under unreadableMembers;
- per-frame geometry was ignored; geometryRuns now splits the native frame
  order into runs of near-identical canvas size (candidate sequence
  boundaries only; no action or direction names).
Test extended (2 cases pass). Supersedes PR #420 if merged.

